[
  {
    "id": "mn_clean_broke",
    "type": "event",
    "align": "any",
    "eras": [
      1,
      2,
      3
    ],
    "bands": [
      "decay",
      "muddle",
      "ascent"
    ],
    "speaker": "judge",
    "text": "The footage of you promising it is being played before the footage of the count. They run it twice, so the country need not remember what you said.",
    "weight": 0,
    "left": {
      "label": "Say you broke it",
      "fx": {
        "inst": 5,
        "base": -5,
        "public": 3
      },
      "drift": 5
    },
    "right": {
      "label": "Say it was conditional",
      "fx": {
        "inst": -5,
        "public": -4,
        "base": 3,
        "order": 2
      },
      "drift": -5
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mn_broad_broke",
    "type": "event",
    "align": "any",
    "eras": [
      1,
      2,
      3
    ],
    "bands": [
      "decay",
      "muddle",
      "ascent"
    ],
    "speaker": "organizer",
    "text": "One of the three has stopped being asked to things. It was never decided, and the room has quietly stopped setting out a chair.",
    "weight": 0,
    "left": {
      "label": "Set the chair back out",
      "fx": {
        "money": -6,
        "public": 4
      },
      "drift": 5
    },
    "right": {
      "label": "Govern with the two",
      "fx": {
        "base": 4,
        "public": -5,
        "inst": -4,
        "order": 2
      },
      "drift": -5
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mn_loyal_broke",
    "type": "event",
    "align": "any",
    "eras": [
      1,
      2,
      3
    ],
    "bands": [
      "decay",
      "muddle",
      "ascent"
    ],
    "speaker": "chief",
    "text": "The rest of them have worked out that the promise about the cabinet was a promise about a cabinet, not about them.",
    "weight": 0,
    "left": {
      "label": "Tell the rest: safe",
      "fx": {
        "order": -4,
        "inst": 4
      },
      "drift": 4
    },
    "right": {
      "label": "Let them wonder",
      "fx": {
        "order": 4,
        "inst": -4,
        "base": -4,
        "public": -2
      },
      "drift": -5
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "mn_decree_broke",
    "type": "event",
    "align": "any",
    "eras": [
      1,
      2,
      3
    ],
    "bands": [
      "decay",
      "muddle",
      "ascent"
    ],
    "speaker": "spin",
    "text": "The ballot boxes came out of the same warehouse you put them in. Somebody has photographed the dust on them.",
    "weight": 0,
    "left": {
      "label": "Call it a correction",
      "fx": {
        "inst": 6,
        "public": 4,
        "base": -5
      },
      "drift": 5
