      2,
      3
    ],
    "bands": [
      "decay",
      "muddle",
      "ascent"
    ],
    "speaker": "spin",
    "text": "Someone has posted you {rival}'s medical records. Nothing in them is a crime. Most of it would still end a career by Sunday.",
